      "evidence": "The postulate assumes only that s is a C1 vector along the worldline. Its listed dependencies provide a Levi–Civita connection on the spacetime manifold but do not define its pullback derivative on a vector field given only along a curve; the postulate also omits the exact supplier def-covariant-derivative-along-a-curve. Thus ∇_U s is not defined by the stated data and dependencies. Add that dependency with its domain and regularity hypotheses, or state the pullback derivative componentwise. The assigned consumer pthm-rpm-bmt-constraints uses this postulate.",
